#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:4
msgid "Diagram"
msgstr "Diagramma"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:6
msgid ""
"The Diagram application in CryptPad is an integration of `Draw.io "
"<https://www.drawio.com/>`__."
msgstr ""
"L'applicazione Diagramma su CryptPad è un'integrazione di `Draw.io <https://"
"www.drawio.com/>`__."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:12
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "Documentazione"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:14
msgid ""
"Please refer to the `Draw.io documentation "
"<https://www.drawio.com/doc/>`__ for a diagram user-guide."
msgstr ""
"Consulta la`documentazione di Draw.io <https://www.drawio.com/doc/>`__ per "
"accedere al manuale utente di Diagramma."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:17
msgid "Toolbars"
msgstr "Barre degli strumenti"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:19
msgid ""
"CryptPad integrates Draw.io diagrams into the same encrypted "
"collaboration system as the other applications. Additionally Draw.io "
"provides a wide range of functions in a tabbed toolbar. This results in a"
" double toolbar that can cause confusion:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:21
msgid ""
"The topmost **CryptPad toolbar** is used for |file-o| **File** operations"
" (including import/export, history, properties, etc) as well as |share-"
"alt| **Share** and |unlock-alt| **Access**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:22
msgid ""
"The **Draw.io toolbar** is used for all functionality within the diagram "
"document itself."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:25
msgid "Import/Export"
msgstr "Importa/Esporta"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:28
msgid "CryptPad toolbar"
msgstr "Barra degli strumenti di CryptPad"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:30
msgid "Import and export diagram files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:32
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |upload| **Import**."
msgstr "|file-o| **Documento** > |upload| **Importa**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:33 ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:36
#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:45
msgid "Supported formats: ``.drawio``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:35
msgid "|file-o| **File** > |download| **Export**."
msgstr "|file-o| **Documento** > |download| **Esporta**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:40
msgid "Draw.io toolbar"
msgstr "Barra degli strumenti di Draw.io"

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:42
msgid "Add content inside your diagram document or preview it in an image format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:44
msgid "**File** > **Import from**."
msgstr "**Documento** > **Importa da**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:47
msgid "**File** > **Export as**."
msgstr "**Documento** > **Esporta come**."

#: ../../user_guide/apps/diagram.rst:48
msgid "Supported formats: ``.png``, ``.jpg``, ``.svg`` & ``.pdf``"
msgstr "Formati supportati: ``.png``, ``.jpg``, ``.svg`` & ``.pdf``"

